Owning gates precede the source commit; every candidate byte is retained.

Usage:
  > owning.nu <repo> <output> <target> <tools> 

Flags:
  -h, --help: Display the help message for this command

Command Type:
  > custom

Parameters:
  repo <string>
  output <string>
  target <string>
  tools <string>

Input/output types:
  ╭───┬───────┬────────╮
  │ # │ input │ output │
  ├───┼───────┼────────┤
  │ 0 │ any   │ any    │
  ╰───┴───────┴────────╯


